# artifact nor creature), and Bot2's Mox Emerald and Sol Ring, cast off it, enter tapped - still tapped on turn 3,
# when Bot1's own second Mox Pearl enters untapped (only opponents' permanents are affected). On turn 4, after Bot2's
# untap step, its Guerrilla Gorilla enters tapped.

